(7406261, 1166791, 140305, '<td valign="top">This makes me smile. We were in London last year at exactly this time, and did a river tour. Brings back great memories!  Great shot by the way:) Love how the wing is mirrored by the building on the right.</td>', 'This makes me smile. We were in London last year at exactly this time, and did a river tour. Brings back great memories!  Great shot by the way:) Love how the wing is mirrored by the building on the right.', '2015-09-25 19:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
