(7406573, 1166770, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of blue flame. To me, that kind of takes away from the fire aspect a bit.<br/> <br/>I find myself wondering what it would look like if you left the flames all orange/red. And used a gelled strobe on the ice to turn those blue (maybe via backlighting).</td>', 'Interesting choice of blue flame. To me, that kind of takes away from the fire aspect a bit. I find myself wondering what it would look like if you left the flames all orange/red. And used a gelled strobe on the ice to turn those blue (maybe via backlighting).', '2015-09-28 13:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7406639, 1166739, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.</td>', 'Nice capture.', '2015-09-28 22:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
