(7406697, 1166643, 98565, '<td valign="top">A lovely composition, well lit. The mothers face is too much processed for my taste - it''s just too flawless to be natural. If this happens to be the real skin without retouching then I''m envious about that perfect texture!!!</td>', 'A lovely composition, well lit. The mothers face is too much processed for my taste - it''s just too flawless to be natural. If this happens to be the real skin without retouching then I''m envious about that perfect texture!!!', '2015-09-29 12:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
