(7406825, 1166643, 135464, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really like your composition. Mom''s face draws my eyes to her eyes. From there I move left to her hair with a short drop to the baby''s face. Then down to Mom''s shoulder to her hair, then up the hair and back to where I started at her eyes.</td>', 'Wow, I really like your composition. Mom''s face draws my eyes to her eyes. From there I move left to her hair with a short drop to the baby''s face. Then down to Mom''s shoulder to her hair, then up the hair and back to where I started at her eyes.', '2015-09-30 04:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7406829, 1166754, 118154, '<td valign="top">I like this image more than a lot.</td>', 'I like this image more than a lot.', '2015-09-30 06:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
